{
  "slug": "azure-devkit",
  "name": "Azure Devkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate Bicep templates and AKS manifests, debug AKS, App Service, and Functions failures, audit Azure RBAC, and scaffold App Service and Azure Functions deployments.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **2 agents**, **3 commands** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `aks-manifest` (Generate AKS-tailored Kubernetes manifests that use Azure Workload Identity, the Azure Key Vault CSI secret driver, and Application…), `app-service-deploy` (Generate an App Service deployment configuration and the az webapp up command to deploy), `az-debug` (Diagnose common Azure failures across AKS, App Service, and Azure Functions), `bicep-template` (Generate idiomatic Bicep templates for common Azure resources), `functions-scaffold` (Scaffold an Azure Functions project with a handler and the right binding definition), `rbac-azure-audit` (Audit Azure role assignments for overly broad permissions)\n- **Agents** (2): `azure-forensics` (Use when an Azure resource (AKS, App Service, Functions, Container App, or related) is failing and the user…), `bicep-author` (Use when writing, restructuring, or reviewing Bicep templates)\n- **Commands** (3): `doctor` (Check the local Azure toolchain), `full-audit` (Run the full Azure audit pass in one command), `whoami` (Show the current Azure identity, active subscription and tenant, and available subscriptions)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install azure-devkit@claude-community` from `mohitkale/azure-devkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "agent": 2,
    "hook": 2,
    "command": 3
  },
